Description: Detects candidate non-reference transposable element insertions
    from genome-aligned sequencing reads. The short-read workflow extracts
    informative soft-clipped sequences, assigns them to transposable element
    references, and summarizes supported breakpoints. An experimental
    long-read workflow extracts insertion, split-alignment, and terminal-clip
    evidence from Oxford Nanopore and PacBio alignments for classification
    against a user-supplied transposable element reference.
